---

---

<section class="py-24 sm:py-32 bg-[#ECECEE] border-b border-slate-300">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mb-16 sm:mb-20">
      <span
        class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-slate-500 block mb-3"
      >
        OUR EXPERTISE
      </span>

      <h2
        class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-5xl font-light text-slate-950 tracking-tight leading-[1.15] mb-6"
      >
        We specialise in the development of luxury villas and commercial
        premises
      </h2>

      <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-[#E5A823]"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Expertise Items -->
    <div class="space-y-20 sm:space-y-28">
      <!-- Luxury Villas -->
      <div
        class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-14 items-center"
      >
        <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-5">
          <h3
            class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-light text-slate-950 tracking-tight"
          >
            Luxury villas
          </h3>

          <div
            class="space-y-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 font-light leading-relaxed"
          >
            <p>
              Ardi Jaya specialises in luxury villa construction, blending
              meticulous planning, superior craftsmanship, and Balinese
              aesthetics. We create bespoke residences, using premium materials
              and advanced techniques, ensuring each villa reflects the client's
              vision while upholding quality and sustainability standards.
            </p>

            <p>
              This dedication to precision solidifies our reputation as a
              leading builder in Bali.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-6">
          <div
            class="relative aspect-[4/3] w-full overflow-hidden bg-slate-300 rounded-none shadow-sm"
          >
            <img
              src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1540541338287-41700207dee6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"
              alt="Luxury Villas Bali - Villa Vida"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center"
              loading="lazy"
              referrerpolicy="no-referrer"
            />

            <div
              class="absolute bottom-3 right-3 bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-xs text-white text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest px-2.5 py-1"
            >
              Villa Vida
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Real Estate Developments -->
      <div
        class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-14 items-center"
      >
        <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-5">
          <h3
            class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-light text-slate-950 tracking-tight"
          >
            Real estate developments
          </h3>

          <div
            class="space-y-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 font-light leading-relaxed"
          >
            <p>
              Ardi Jaya partners with leading developers in Bali, like those
              behind boutique villa compounds and premium residences, to
              construct luxury villa developments. Our collaborative approach
              ensures seamless project execution, leveraging our deep
              understanding of local regulations. Developers trust us due to our
              consistent delivery of high-quality workmanship, meticulous
              attention to detail, and adherence to timelines.
            </p>

            <p>
              This commitment to precision and transparent communication sets us
              apart, making us the preferred choice for exceptional villa
              developments.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-6">
          <div
            class="relative aspect-[4/3] w-full overflow-hidden bg-slate-300 rounded-none shadow-sm"
          >
            <img
              src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"
              alt="Real Estate Developments - Villa Oasis"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center"
              loading="lazy"
              referrerpolicy="no-referrer"
            />

            <div
              class="absolute bottom-3 right-3 bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-xs text-white text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest px-2.5 py-1"
            >
              Villa Oasis
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Commercial Premises -->
      <div
        class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-14 items-center"
      >
        <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-5">
          <h3
            class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-light text-slate-950 tracking-tight"
          >
            Commercial premises
          </h3>

          <div
            class="space-y-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 font-light leading-relaxed"
          >
            <p>
              We excel in developing sophisticated commercial spaces, including
              boutique hotels and office buildings, understanding the unique
              demands of each. We combine innovative design with efficient
              management, ensuring on-time, on-budget delivery.
            </p>

            <p>
              Prioritising functionality, aesthetics, and sustainability, we
              craft spaces that meet business objectives and enhance Bali's
              commercial landscape.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-6">
          <div
            class="relative aspect-[4/3] w-full overflow-hidden bg-slate-300 rounded-none shadow-sm"
          >
            <img
              src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517248135467-4c7edcad34c4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"
              alt="Commercial Premises Bali"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center"
              loading="lazy"
              referrerpolicy="no-referrer"
            />

            <div
              class="absolute bottom-3 right-3 bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-xs text-white text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest px-2.5 py-1"
            >
              Commercial & Boutique
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
